/**
 * Seed data — the single source of truth for both the in-memory demo store
 * and `supabase/seed.sql` (generated by `npm run seed:sql`).
 *
 * RULES (see BUILD_PROMPT §19):
 *  - Public content here is REAL and credited: every item names its source
 *    organisation, links to the source page and carries its licence.
 *  - Photographs are only bundled (public/media) when their licence allows
 *    reuse (public domain, GODL-India, CC BY / CC BY-SA); the credit and
 *    licence travel with the item. Everything else is link-and-credit only.
 *  - "Archive notes" are short summaries written for this portal from the
 *    linked source page. Numbers in them are copied from that source.
 *  - NCPOR's own material is never copied: external link and credit only.
 *  - The only fictional rows are the two staff-only items that demonstrate
 *    internal and embargoed release control; they are `is_sample: true` and
 *    never public.
 */
